sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (curl / opencode)
    participant N as nginx :11435 (TLS)
    participant UP as ollama_pool (round-robin)
    participant SC as socat unix socket
    participant O as ollama instance
    participant M as shared model cache<br/>(var/lib/ollama)

    C->>N: POST /api/chat (TLS 1.3, local CA)
    N->>UP: proxy_pass
    UP->>SC: pick a healthy socket (round-robin)
    SC->>O: TCP :11434
    O->>M: load model blobs
    O-->>O: inference on NVIDIA GB10
    O-->>SC: SSE stream
    SC-->>UP: stream
    UP-->>N: stream
    N-->>C: SSE stream (proxy_buffering off)
